# AI authority

- AI may draft, analyze, recommend, and verify.
- AI may not publish, launch ads, change budgets, contact customers, modify production websites, or delete public content in Phase 1.
- Capabilites are enforced in `@marketing-os/contracts` / runtime — not prompts alone.
- Level 0–1 may execute internally; Level 2–3 execution is blocked.
- Brand Guardian may reject outputs; do not bypass verification for convenience.
